      "writtenOn": "2023-06-30T10:48:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about resetting lastScheduledTask to null here ? To make sure we maintain the invariant \"lastScheduledTask is the next task that will be executed\". calculateTimeToRunLocked relies on this invariant, for example when returning `lastScheduledTask.timeToRun`. This also makes sure that on stop, the state is reset to the original state.\n\nYou\u0027ll need to note down the value before calling cancelRequestTaskLocked in processResponse in that case",
      "revId": "ad1acf8995575216d1c13199fb454b42ba989232",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
