      "writtenOn": "2023-06-30T10:48:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would be nice to be able to set the fields as final, and not modify them here, as it gives guarantees for constructing/using the QueryTaskConfig across threads (ask Jean about the final freeze).\n\nCould you have the constructor take the values as argument instead, and using local variables to avoid modifying the members ?",
